SF0117 Shared parenting.
Sponsored By: Senator(s) Pearson, Boner, Hutchings and Laursen, D
and Representative(s) Andrew, Angelos, Kelly, Lucas,
McCann and Smith, S
AN ACT relating to child custody; providing a presumption for issuance of an
order of shared child custody as specified; providing definitions; specifying
applicability; and providing for an effective date.
